==Battleground==
*2 [[Imperator Sael]]s spawn, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 66.67~70 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'Prude]] spawns as the boss after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]s spawn after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Imperator Sael]] spawns after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Techn-Old Hyena]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Doctor K.O.]] spawns after 140 seconds<sup>4,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Stall out the stage until you can kill both Condemned Pengs, as they are the only enemies not targeted by [[Master of Selection Darvin (Special Cat)|Master of Selection Clawvin]]. He will effectively hard-carry this stage, being an insurmountable wall that the enemies can't hope to kill while you take care to deal with the main threats. When Techn-Old Hyena spawns, send [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]], and [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:NX]] to burst it down while it's Weakened by Clawvin; Hyena is basically the only other threatening prescence here, and getting it off the field means you are free to absolutely jump Le'Prude with [[Talents|Talented]] [[Dom Cat (Special Cat)|Dark Lazers]].

